{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The world is old\u2026 ancient.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The tales you are about to hear are lost in the nights of time.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Two moons still shone in the sky, and the world was still young, prehistoric and wild.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Only Atlan, the land of the created, still carried faint glimmers of civilization.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>But even it was already too old, too decadent\u2026 and would soon vanish forever.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>So let me tell you the memories of those ancestral days,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>of men and women who fought, prayed, loved, and hated,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>so that all would not be lost.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Let me tell you\u2026</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Age of Barbarians\u2019 Chronicles. </i> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A SAVAGE PREHISTORIC WORLD TO DISCOVER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ancient lost land called Atlan, full of legends, mysteries, prehistoric beasts, nightmarish creatures and dangers of all kinds, populated by civilizations with ancient customs and unique mythology.<br> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REFINED AND BRUTAL COMBAT MECHANICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The art of combat involves dodges, parries, blocks, attacks of various types, counterattacks, rolls, unbalances, special powers, and blood-filled fatalities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LOOT ARMOR, WEAPONS AND SHINING TREASURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ancient dungeons of Atlan conceal numerous treasures, including powerful weapons, shields, armor, helmets, rings, and so on, which increase your combat efficiency.<br> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OLD-SCHOOL RPG AND DUNGEON CRAWLER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Age of Barbarians Chronicles</i> is drenched in old-school spirit, from its RPG system, based on the tabletop game of the same name, to its Sword &amp; Sorcery setting and classic dungeon-crawling exploration.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BARBARIC COOPERATIVE ACTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join forces with a friend and plunge into the savage world of Atlan. Explore deadly dungeons, uncover ancient treasures, and battle together to survive the campaign.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SAVE COMPANIONS AND LET THEM HELP YOU</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A party of adventurers is stronger than one hero alone. However, remember that both treasure and experience points are shared among companions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HANDCRAFTED AND PROCEDURAL DUNGEONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many dungeons are carefully hand-designed, but at the same time, you will encounter many others that are procedural, offering you countless combinations and making each exploration unique and rewarding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1753500?t=1761214466","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1753500/348892e1debcb89f8c321474c805b611da68a2ac/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761214466","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1753500/567e98ffcba891d999b88c9413f3b905909e5521/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761214466","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1753500/567e98ffcba891d999b88c9413f3b905909e5521/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761214466","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"Age of Barbarians Chronicle features intense violence, graphic blood and gore, along with nudity and sexual content."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The world is old\u2026 ancient.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The tales you are about to hear are lost in the nights of time.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Two moons still shone in the sky, and the world was still young, prehistoric and wild.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Only Atlan, the land of the created, still carried faint glimmers of civilization.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>But even it was already too old, too decadent\u2026 and would soon vanish forever.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>So let me tell you the memories of those ancestral days,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>of men and women who fought, prayed, loved, and hated,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>so that all would not be lost.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Let me tell you\u2026</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Age of Barbarians\u2019 Chronicles. </i> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A SAVAGE PREHISTORIC WORLD TO DISCOVER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ancient lost land called Atlan, full of legends, mysteries, prehistoric beasts, nightmarish creatures and dangers of all kinds, populated by civilizations with ancient customs and unique mythology.<br> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REFINED AND BRUTAL COMBAT MECHANICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The art of combat involves dodges, parries, blocks, attacks of various types, counterattacks, rolls, unbalances, special powers, and blood-filled fatalities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LOOT ARMOR, WEAPONS AND SHINING TREASURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ancient dungeons of Atlan conceal numerous treasures, including powerful weapons, shields, armor, helmets, rings, and so on, which increase your combat efficiency.<br> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OLD-SCHOOL RPG AND DUNGEON CRAWLER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Age of Barbarians Chronicles</i> is drenched in old-school spirit, from its RPG system, based on the tabletop game of the same name, to its Sword &amp; Sorcery setting and classic dungeon-crawling exploration.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BARBARIC COOPERATIVE ACTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join forces with a friend and plunge into the savage world of Atlan. Explore deadly dungeons, uncover ancient treasures, and battle together to survive the campaign.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SAVE COMPANIONS AND LET THEM HELP YOU</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A party of adventurers is stronger than one hero alone. However, remember that both treasure and experience points are shared among companions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HANDCRAFTED AND PROCEDURAL DUNGEONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many dungeons are carefully hand-designed, but at the same time, you will encounter many others that are procedural, offering you countless combinations and making each exploration unique and rewarding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Crian Soft"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1753500/16389b9311ec5386ce26f70a94545a0bb86e38cc/header.jpg?t=1761214466","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1753500/742364673/57a4b4485d01f26546fd07c666497457176899e9/1760711822/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760713887","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1753500/742364673/57a4b4485d01f26546fd07c666497457176899e9/1760711822/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760713887","highlight":true,"hls_h264":